  "aiContextParagraph": "Jair Bolsonaro, aged 71, has been receiving medical care at the DF Star hospital in Brasilia since November 20, 2026, following reports of severe abdominal pain. Earlier updates from the medical team indicated that he had also been diagnosed with pneumonia during his stay. Over the past few days, medical bulletins have reported gradual clinical improvement, noting that he is currently undergoing physical therapy and has transitioned to a liquid diet. The medical team recently confirmed the removal of his nasogastric tube and noted the return of spontaneous intestinal activity. Public interest has recently touched upon aspects of his diet and recovery, with social media commentary emerging regarding his nutritional intake. However, the medical team remains focused on his recovery process within the intensive care unit, with no specific timeline provided for his eventual discharge.",
